Contributions (as in the paper)
F.G., S.D.: software, investigation, data curation, visualization, writing (review and editing).
K.B.: conceptualization, methodology, formal analysis, theorems and proofs, supervision, funding acquisition,
writing (original draft, review and editing).

AI assistance: Claude Code (Anthropic; version 2.1.308, with Claude Opus models, Claude Opus 5.5 in the final stage)
was used to write and run the analysis code and the plotting scripts, to check the numbers in the text against the
result files, and to draft and edit parts of the text. All theorems were proposed by K.B., and the AI assistant helped
with their proofs, which the authors verified by reading them line by line and by numerical checks with code
independent of the formulas. The authors reviewed the code, reran the analyses and checked every number and statement
(see README.md, "Use of AI tools", and the acknowledgments of the paper).
